WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:08.050
Apparently, the train broke down
over the&nbsp;Guadalupe Bridge.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.220
Service crew found it like this.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.810
Lots of blood, no bodies…

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.730
and a pile
of missing persons reports.

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:17.730
Excuse me.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.850
Greetings, young Trese.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.520
Good evening, Nuno.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.490
There was a time
when magic in the world

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:28.240
was a natural part of life.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.780
That age has passed.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.330
People fear
what they don't understand.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:36.410
That's why our family
has always been the&nbsp;bridge

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.620
between mankind
and the supernatural.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.420
What the hell are we dealing with?

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.840
A lot of tribes are on edge,
making bad deals with badder folk.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:52.470
That balance you and your father
have tried so desperately

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.600
to maintain is at its end.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:58.930
You're treading
on very thin ice, young Trese.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:04.400
Can't be too sure
about the underworld&nbsp;these days.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.740
Please, help me.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:16.200
You are the babaylan-mandirigma.
Healer and warrior.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.750
Reveal what is concealed.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:20.960
You were born ready.

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:24.040
Hank, the creature is a Tiyanak.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:26.380
Do you hear it calling for me?

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:30.340
You want my advice?
Keep your heads down.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:32.720
They're coming for revenge.

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:36.810
If the Lakan gets
in the way, kill her.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.310
There's something bigger
going on here.

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:43.230
The tribes need to be united.

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:49.030
The tempest is brewing

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:51.320
and there are liars
amongst your allies.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.660
Come on, boys.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:56.580
Let's put an end to this.

